OL,3,GNEWSATroubles legacy bill is not an
OL,4,Aamnesty for soldiers - NI secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe secretary of state for Northern
OL,7,FIreland has rejected claims that
OL,8,Fplanned changes to the government's
OL,9,FTroubles legacy bill amount to an
OL,10,F"amnesty" for former soldiers.
OL,12,FSir Chris Bryant said it was
OL,13,F"completely wrong" to suggest a
OL,14,Frequirement for the attorney general to
OL,15,Fconsent to serious Troubles-related
OL,16,Fprosecutions was designed to pardon
OL,17,Fveterans.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
